"Ah, Mrs. Pumpkin! I've come to welcome you!"

210
00:16:20,224 --> 00:16:26,824
この夜はいつの間にか夢を壊したのだろうか
When in the world did this night break the dream?

211
00:16:38,824 --> 00:16:47,524
まだここで踊っていたいのよ夢のような錯乱
I still want to dance right here in this dream-like delirium.

212
00:16:47,824 --> 00:16:53,824
ほら吐き出した快楽と火が灯るランタンは
Look, the pleasure we breathed out and the lantern with a lit flame—

213
00:16:54,024 --> 00:16:59,524
ねぇララルララ私と踊ろうか 返事なんくる筈も
Hey la-la-la-la, shall we dance together? A reply is bound to never come—

214
00:17:00,024 --> 00:17:08,524
ほら棺はどこにもなくなった つまらないや
Look, the coffin has disappeared from everywhere. How boring.

215
00:17:08,824 --> 00:17:13,524
沈み込んだ泥の中 朝を待った泥の中
